(:researchModes :v 4 :adopted "2026-11-14" :ev (RESEARCH-DEPTH) :override ".asl/researchModes.asn in the workspace replaces this table whole" :note "every figure is an adopted normative ceiling or floor, not a target and not a measurement: a unit takes sources in batches of :batchSources and stops as soon as it is sufficient (:minFacts verified facts from :minSources sources, every initial query asked, no open contradiction), as saturated after :saturationBatches batches without a new verified fact, and otherwise at :maxSourcesPerSub or the end of its queries; sources that contradict each other keep it going until one side leads by :resolveMargin sources; a finished unit may grow children from the open questions its extraction marked, down to :maxDepth, at most :maxChildren per node and :maxNodes in the tree (sub-questions included), each sharing :childSharedTerms key terms with the root topic or its parent and cut to :childChars; :maxSearches :maxFetches :maxModelCalls :wallSeconds are shared by the whole tree; :wallSeconds bounds the run: a model stage (every chain entry attempt, the audit included) and a fetch start only with wall left and get no more than the wall left as their timeout, and a run that passes its wall returns the partial report with :stoppedBy :wall, unaudited when no wall is left for the audit; a search stage keeps the provider timeouts of search.asl, so the worst case is the wall plus one search stage (flash 180 s, deep 600 s, exhaustive 1800 s, each plus at most about 60 s); :minSources counts registrable hosts and facts with the same evidence text count once; a unit also stops as queriesExhausted, and a batch of unfetched pages or one whose extractor chain gave no reply does not count toward saturation; :maxModelCalls counts stages (decomposition, one extraction per batch, the audit), not chain fallbacks inside a stage; :pipeline single is the fixed one-search pipeline pinned by searchResearchFixture.asn and is what :flash falls back to when no table is readable")
(:mode :id flash :pipeline plan :depth flash :engine auto :decompose none :subQuestions 1 :queriesPerSub 1 :resultsPerQuery 5 :fetchPerQuery 5 :batchSources 2 :maxSourcesPerSub 6 :saturationBatches 1 :resolveMargin 2 :maxDepth 0 :maxChildren 0 :maxNodes 1 :childSharedTerms 1 :childChars 120 :counterQuery false :minFacts 2 :minSources 1 :followUpRounds 0 :followUpQueries 0 :maxSearches 2 :maxFetches 6 :maxModelCalls 5 :wallSeconds 180 :queryChars 200 :reformulations ())
(:mode :id deep :pipeline plan :depth targeted :engine auto :decompose model :subQuestions 5 :queriesPerSub 1 :resultsPerQuery 6 :fetchPerQuery 6 :batchSources 2 :maxSourcesPerSub 10 :saturationBatches 2 :resolveMargin 2 :maxDepth 1 :maxChildren 2 :maxNodes 10 :childSharedTerms 2 :childChars 120 :counterQuery false :minFacts 2 :minSources 2 :followUpRounds 1 :followUpQueries 1 :maxSearches 20 :maxFetches 48 :maxModelCalls 30 :wallSeconds 600 :queryChars 200 :reformulations ("explained" "benchmark results" "limitations"))
(:mode :id exhaustive :pipeline plan :depth matrix :engine auto :decompose model :subQuestions 8 :queriesPerSub 2 :resultsPerQuery 10 :fetchPerQuery 9 :batchSources 3 :maxSourcesPerSub 24 :saturationBatches 3 :resolveMargin 3 :maxDepth 2 :maxChildren 3 :maxNodes 30 :childSharedTerms 2 :childChars 120 :counterQuery true :minFacts 6 :minSources 5 :followUpRounds 2 :followUpQueries 2 :maxSearches 96 :maxFetches 300 :maxModelCalls 120 :wallSeconds 1800 :queryChars 200 :reformulations ("explained" "benchmark results" "evaluation study" "comparison" "survey paper"))
